{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Require all HGVs to use mandatory vehicle-dimension-aware satellite navigation",
        "additional_details": "Drivers to enter the vehicle's weight, height and width before a journey.\r\n \r\nThe system to use the dimensions when calculating the route & take account low bridges, weight limits, width restrictions & unsuitable roads.\r\n \r\nTo apply to all HGVs operating in Great Britain regardless of whether they are travelling in, entering/leaving GB or passing through.\r\n \r\nThe requirement to apply to vehicles irrespective of ownership and enforced by law.",
        "background": "Require every HGV operating on GB roads to use an approved commercial-vehicle satnav system and use this to calculate the route. We think this will reduce the number of bridge strikes and reduce damage to unsuitable roads.",
